    "text": "Details\n100% recommend (19 reviews)\nOpen now\nGuernsey, Guernsey\nContact info\npurereflections.gsy\n\n07781 414404\npurereflections@yahoo.com\n+44 7781 414404\nPure Reflections Window Cleaning Service\nPhotos\n\nFeatured\nPure Reflections Window Cleaning Service\nWouldn’t it be nice if your annual gutter clear, patio clean and exterior maintenance were already taken care of?\n\nOur new Home Care Packages are designed to keep your property looking fantastic all year round while spreading the cost into manageable monthly payments.\n\nMany customers already pay regularly for window cleaning. Why not include other services such as:\n\n✔ Gutter clearing\n✔ Fascia & soffit cleaning\n✔ Patio & driveway cleaning\n✔ Softwashing\n✔ Roof treatments\n\nNo large one-off bills. No forgetting important maintenance.\n\nJust one simple plan tailored to your home.\n\nInterested? Send us a message and we’ll put together a package that works for you.\n\n🏡 Pure Reflections Exterior Cleaning\nPure Reflections Window Cleaning Service\nDid you know what we offer at Pure Reflections?\n\nFrom window cleaning to full exterior cleaning, gutter clears and vacuums, pressure washing and more, we keep your home looking its best all year round.\n\nIf you’d like a free no obligation quote, just send us a message and we’ll get you sorted. 🧼✨"
